OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies murdering partner after
OL,4,Aalleged glass bottle attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has denied murdering his
OL,7,F23-year-old partner at her flat in the
OL,8,Fnorth of Glasgow.
OL,10,FAlexander Brennan, 54, is on trial at
OL,11,Fthe High Court in Glasgow accused of
OL,12,Fkilling Brodie MacGregor in August
OL,13,F2024.
OL,15,FProsecutors claim Brennan punched and
OL,16,Fslapped MacGregor, and repeatedly
OL,17,Fstruck her with glass bottles - some of
OL,18,Fwhich were broken.
OL,20,FHe is also accused of hitting her with
OL,21,Fa microwave plate and inflicting blunt
OL,22,Fforce trauma injuries by means unknown.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
